<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2>Getting Started with Dotkernel Admin V4</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong><a rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://github.com/dotkernel/admin" target="_blank">DotKernel's PSR-7 Admin</a> </strong> is an application based on <strong><a rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://getlaminas.org/" target="_blank">Mezzio</a></strong>, with the main purpose of managing and displaying tabular data from one or more databases components.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>On 19 July 2022 <strong>Dotkernel Admin V4</strong> has been officially released. <strong>Dotkernel Admin V4</strong> comes with various interesting features and overall improvement of the core framework.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

